n. KB Bar: preview/selected split, Enter commit, preview header, pane layout
    [x] 'content/web-ui/frontend/keyboard-bar.js': Split attr state into preview and selected
        - New private fields: `#previewDomain`, `#previewPrompt`, `#previewRendered`
        - Existing fields `#selectedDomain`, `#selectedPrompt`, `#renderedPrompt` remain as the committed set
        - `#onDomainKey`: writes to `#previewDomain`; prompt button states refresh from `#previewDomain?.prompts`
        - `#onPromptKey`: still calls `apiClient.renderPrompt(...)`; stores response in `#previewRendered`; sets `#previewPrompt`
        - `#refreshAllStates`: domain/prompt button highlighting reads from `#previewDomain` / `#previewDomain?.prompts`
        - `#refreshRendered`: pane text reads from `#previewRendered`
        - `#updateHeaderLabel` reads selected only; `getRenderedPromptText()` reads `#renderedPrompt`; `expandPaths` reads/writes `#selectedPrompt.expanded_paths` and sets `#renderedPrompt`
    [x] 'content/web-ui/frontend/keyboard-bar.js': Enter commits preview → selected
        - In `#handleKeydown` Enter path, before dispatching `prompt-selected`:
            - `#selectedDomain = #previewDomain`
            - `#selectedPrompt = #previewPrompt`
            - `#renderedPrompt = #previewRendered`
        - Then existing behaviour: dispatch `prompt-selected`, collapse bar, focus input
    [x] 'content/web-ui/frontend/keyboard-bar.js': Add preview header, fix pane layout
        - New element `#kb-preview-label` inside `#kb-zone2`, directly above `#rendered`:
            - Displays `#previewDomain?.name → #previewPrompt?.name` (or "— → —" if unset)
            - Prominent: `text-sm font-mono text-[#d1d5db]` with `border-l-2 border-[#6ee7b7] pl-2`
            - `#updatePreviewLabel(msg)` accepts either a free-form status message or falls back to the `domain → prompt` pair
            - Updated in `#onDomainKey`, `#onPromptKey`, and on Enter commit
        - `#kb-header` / `#kb-status` now reflects **selected** only (committed state); transient preview feedback redirected to `#kb-preview-label`
        - `#rendered` div: dropped `max-h-64`, added `flex-1 overflow-y-auto`
        - `keyboard-bar` host: added `overflow-hidden`; on expand adds `flex-1 min-h-0` so the element participates in the `h-screen` flex column and fills remaining vertical space; on collapse removes those classes
        - `#kb-zone2`: `flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0` — definite-height chain resolved, scrollbar functional

n. KB Bar: keyboard scrolling for rendered prompt pane
